### Get Sample Order
GET http://localhost:8147/api/orders/sample

### Validate Valid Order
POST http://localhost:8147/api/orders/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "o100",
  "customer": {
    "id": "c100",
    "name": "Jane Doe",
    "email": "jane@example.com"
  },
  "items": [
    {
      "id": "p100",
      "name": "Keyboard",
      "price": 45.0
    }
  ],
  "metadata": {
    "source": "mobile"
  },
  "orderDate": "2024-10-10T10:00:00"
}

### Validate Invalid Order
POST http://localhost:8147/api/orders/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "",
  "customer": {
    "id": "c101",
    "name": "Invalid User",
    "email": "invalid-email"
  },
  "items": []
}
